{"3709990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tale of the Bullet Knight", "steam_appid": 3709990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/8e8fe54ebefb9d42d569d7790022d669.avif?t=1787452219\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras_big/8e8fe54ebefb9d42d569d7790022d669.webp?t=1787452219 width=1560 height=3184 /></span><strong>What’s this?</strong> It's a boomer shooter infused with roguelite elements, hand-crafted frame-by-frame animations, and vibrant pseudo-3D graphics that push the limits of speed and intensity! The higher the difficulty, the higher the speed, the faster the action!<br><br>The game blends thousands of hand-drawn and digitally polished textures with 3D objects, sprites, environmental fog, and god rays, creating a unique mix of nostalgia and the kind of innovation we've all been craving.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/bc3840963c69f5b11afe3fe9a0e99d88.poster.avif?t=1787452219\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/bc3840963c69f5b11afe3fe9a0e99d88.webm?t=1787452219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/bc3840963c69f5b11afe3fe9a0e99d88.mp4?t=1787452219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Step into the chaotic world of <strong>Bullet Knight</strong>, where every moment is a thrilling ride packed with adrenaline and action. Experience lightning-fast combat (and yes—it gets even faster as the difficulty increases) that keeps you on your toes as you dodge, shoot, and slash your way through relentless waves of enemies while navigating the unpredictable terrain of the Middleworld.<br><br>Use the environment to your advantage with spikes, bottomless pits, good old red barrels, and stationary ballistas. Combine throwable vortexes and Molotov cocktails, lure enemies into deadly hazards, and bunny-hop like a feral predator on the hunt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/aa1753731d986a47b2724c078b6c5da2.poster.avif?t=1787452219\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/aa1753731d986a47b2724c078b6c5da2.webm?t=1787452219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/aa1753731d986a47b2724c078b6c5da2.mp4?t=1787452219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enhance, upgrade, and customize the Bullet Knight to become stronger, smarter, and faster, adding a healthy dose of bloodthirstiness (crank it up tenfold—both in-game and as a player) as you unlock powerful abilities and unique weapon modifications tailored to your playstyle.<br><br>Mix weapon upgrades together to create monstrous combinations from scavenged parts that the fairy Eve provides throughout your journey.<br><br>Enjoy painstakingly crafted frame-by-frame animations forged by a relentlessly hardworking animator, bringing every character and enemy to life while adding depth and fluidity to every battle. Venture into the Middleworld—a realm designed as the ultimate playground for gods, where competition and entertainment reign supreme.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/ee1fabf1320f7d132384299dcf9a8046.poster.avif?t=1787452219\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/ee1fabf1320f7d132384299dcf9a8046.webm?t=1787452219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/ee1fabf1320f7d132384299dcf9a8046.mp4?t=1787452219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face off against formidable enemy hordes that will test your skills and strategy while rewarding you with powerful upgrades and revealing the secrets of this enigmatic land. Discover hidden secrets and Easter eggs—perhaps even a secret level or two—but that's entirely up to your curiosity to uncover and enjoy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/179f06870124bb378c6bddf67acb4e63.poster.avif?t=1787452219\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/179f06870124bb378c6bddf67acb4e63.webm?t=1787452219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/179f06870124bb378c6bddf67acb4e63.mp4?t=1787452219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enemies, traps, helpful characters, and the world itself are all here to deliver an unforgettable experience for both newcomers and seasoned veterans.<br><br>Are you ready to embrace the chaos and prove your worth in the arena of the gods? Join the fight and dive into a world where speed meets strategy!<br><br> P.S.: the easy mode might not be so easy, however, the champion's rating will be compared by the <strong>HARDEST OF MODES!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709990/extras/cce84b6a32278abf2dd1e622121a2291.poster.avif?t=1787452219\" width=800 height=80